# Every text file of the engine keeps LF line endings on every machine, Windows included: the engine reads its own
# recipes, guides, fixtures and goldens line by line, and a checkout that turned them into CRLF changed what every one
# of those reads found. A team's own files are the team's; the engine reads them whichever ending they have.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never text, whatever their content looks like.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
*.gz binary
